    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "• Immaculate A rated two-bedroom apartment extending to approx. 84 sq.m/ 904 sq.ft \n• Accommodation comprises of hallway, utility closet, kitchen/dining/living room, two bedrooms, walk in wardrobes (plumbed for en-suite), family bathroom and two separate balconies\n• Excellent standard of finish throughout, featuring triple-glazed windows installed in 2021, a new condenser boiler fitted in 2025, stylish made to measure sliding wardrobes, cleverly designed walk-in wardrobes, and two balconies, including an exceptionally spacious balcony.\n• Highly convenient, family-friendly location 200m from Clane village, within easy walking distance of a range of excellent amenities, including well-regarded schools only 200m from primary and 600 from a secondary school, supermarkets, cafés, boutiques, restaurants, sports clubs, and leisure facilities\n• Easy access to the M4 and M7 motorways, providing convenient routes to Dublin and surrounding counties\n• Clane is also well served by regular bus services 120 A ,120 B ,120X, one going directly to UCD Campus, while nearby towns such as Maynooth and Sallins offer rail links to the capital, making the area ideal for commuters\n\nGuide Price\n298,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Hallway 1.29m x 3.00m\nSemi solid flooring, utility closets with additional storage, intercom system.\n\nInner Hallway 1.00 x 3.80m\nSemi-solid flooring, integrated shelving, cloak rack. \n\nBathroom 2.00m x 2.98m\nFully tiled, deep filled bath with shower head, w.c., w.h.b., fitted mirror, storage cabinets, towel radiator, fitted corner shelving unit. \n \nBedroom 2 3.66m x 3.12m\nSemi-solid flooring, fitted made to measure slide robes, fitted shelving, French doors to large shared balcony area with Master bedroom.\n\nMaster Bedroom 3.10m x 4.74m\nCarpet, fitted made to measure slide robes, French doors to large balcony area.\n\nWalk-in wardrobe 1.93 x 2.00m\nSemi-solid flooring, fitted drawers, built in shelving units, plumbing in place to convert to en-suite.\n\nKitchen/ Living Room 4.00m x 9.64m\nPorcelain tiled floor, fully fitted kitchen, breakfast bar area with integrated shelving, soft close pan drawers, electric oven, hob, extractor fan, splash back tiles, stainless steel deep filled sink, integrated dishwasher, plumbed Samsung washing machine, Samsung fridge freezer. Well defined dining and living room with semi-solid flooring, blinds, ample space with feature wall, TV point, additional shelved storage cabinet, French doors to second balcony area. \n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 84 sq.m.\nBuilt in 2006 \nLift and staircase access\nNew condenser boiler 2025\nNew triple glazed windows 2021\nManagement fees: approx 2,400 per annum (managed by Henry Wiltshire).\nTwo balconies, one very large\nNon designated ample parking\nCreche within estate\n\nItems Included in sale:\nFixtures, fittings and window dressing, electric hob, oven, extractor fan, integrated dishwasher, washing machine and Samsung fridge freezer\n\nServices:\nMains water\nGas fired central heating\n\nBER A\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W91 XH00\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nJill Wright\n045 832020\n"
      },
